\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 short description: 
\f1\fs26 \'b1zweihundertsechs is a series of vessels exploring the relationship between fragility, structural strength and the capacity to hold.
\f0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
